{"title":"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems\">2003 AMC 12B #8</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems\">2003 AMC 10B #13</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/891efd9a27650e638592a8a274ea57c279725e33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\clubsuit(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> denote the sum of the digits of the positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/2/eb2de7a9d2ecc7d2fb7dca82a7bc6de9e1e488de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\clubsuit(8)=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4edc76e725705a6ac9eca665fa4d6ddc4be7f910.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\clubsuit(123)=1+2+3=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" />. For how many two-digit values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/4/b749a8c7b00df2042ac25557fe341710db24f7b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\clubsuit(\\clubsuit(x))=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/5/9e57faea979cf8d6f3aed0d93857be9bb505bf3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 9 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"362\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/3/4e3f79707f61c6f51c60721ce914bec12320ef35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\clubsuit (x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb6a88c3c41c84ea0964afaeac9d7ba6f7c79961.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq 99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/f/ecf6c02f6e12699f850b5fda229808fce7cead85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\leq 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />. Thus if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/0/ac075f16724360b21252345292599c900211d65d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\clubsuit (y)=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b0e1404de4eca35c42876bcc83707b753e990e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c52f2821f1a68dc474c90d7acb0e279c7fca51c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />. The 3 values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/9/2c9b419643c3f5c150b94d73abd54c87f1f26da8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\clubsuit (x)=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> are 12, 21, and 30, and the 7 values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/d/14d57f230f71078d2b8cf5cb8e454982200fd023.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\clubsuit (x)=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> are 39, 48, 57, 66, 75, 84, and 93. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd7ae6c302dec5c5be789f3d4d9be37d000d0772.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /> values in all.\n</p><p>~Andrew_Lu/Mismatchedcubing\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B\">2003 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</